    "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034640/extras/e38d38a4707f44dc97edcc1bd2634712.avif?t=1718089265\" width=600 height=164 /></span><br><br>\u201c<i>If a tree falls in a forest and no one is around to hear it, does it make a sound?</i>\u201d - George Berkeley<br><br>You find yourself on a highway looking for a way to fix your car. When you come across a nearby gas station, it seems to be abandoned. Or is it? In &quot;<strong>Distraught</strong>&quot; you're thrown into a series of inexplicable events, with only your wits to guide you out of this treacherous place. Can you make it ?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034640/extras/7f7d4fab1488535d64ec41c000f7aa08.avif?t=1718089265\" width=600 height=164 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique pixelated graphics<br></li><li> Large explorable environments<br></li><li> Immersive sound design<br></li><li> Unique item-use mechanics</li></ul>",
